xtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本「申」下有「契丹王李婆固與公主入朝」十一字；乙十一行本同，惟「婆」作「娑」；孔本同；張校同，「固」作「圉」；退齋校本仍作 「固」。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本「申」下有「契丹王李婆固与公主入朝」十一字；乙十一行本同，惟「婆」作「娑」；孔本同；张校同，「固」作「圉」；退斋校本仍作 「固」。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bca98a43-db0e-11ef-bf63-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"bca98a42-db0e-11ef-9c43-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"岐山縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"岐山县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bca98a4b-db0e-11ef-b2da-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"bca98a4c-db0e-11ef-acd7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"岐州","place_name_jianti_auto":"岐州","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"bca98a4d-db0e-11ef-8112-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"岐山縣，隋置，屬岐州。琛，丑林翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"岐山县，隋置，属岐州。琛，丑林翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"bca98a4a-db0e-11ef-b998-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"王仁琛","people_name_jianti_auto":"王仁琛","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bca98a4f-db0e-11ef-8190-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"仁皎","people_name_jianti_auto":"仁皎","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"bca98a50-db0e-11ef-b768-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"王仁琛，蓋仁皎羣從。","note_content_jianti_auto":"王仁琛，盖仁皎群从。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":87,"tongjian_id":"bca98a4e-db0e-11ef-a2bc-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"輿，衆也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"舆，众也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":92,"tongjian_id":"bca98a51-db0e-11ef-a875-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"岐山","place_name_jianti_auto":"岐山","place_note":"陕西省岐山县","resolved_place_entity_id":1891,"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"bcaa4013-db0e-11ef-8458-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"12十一月，壬申。上以岐山令王仁琛，藩邸故吏，墨敕令與五品官。宋璟奏：「故舊恩私，則有大例，除官資歷，非無公道。仁琛曏緣舊恩，已獲優改，今若再蒙超獎，遂於諸人不類；又是后族，須杜輿言。乞下吏部檢勘，苟無負犯，於格應留，請依資稍優注擬。」從之。","content_fanyi":"十一月十八日壬申，唐玄宗因为岐山县令王仁琛是自己居藩邸时的故吏，直接用墨敕将他擢升为五品官。宋璟上奏说：“陛下对故旧的私人恩遇，在典章制度上已有相应大例；授予官职的资历条件，也并非没有公正标准。王仁琛过去已因旧恩得到从优迁改，如今如果再蒙破格提拔，就会与众人差距太大；况且他又属于皇后家族，必须防止舆论的非议。臣请求把这件事交给吏部核查勘验，如果他没有过失罪愆，依照规定应予留任，就请按照他的资历略加从优拟授官职。”玄宗采纳了他的主张。","content_jianti_auto":"12十一月，壬申。上以岐山令王仁琛，藩邸故吏，墨敕令与五品官。宋璟奏：「故旧恩私，则有大例，除官资历，非无公道。仁琛向缘旧恩，已获优改，今若再蒙超奖，遂于诸人不类；又是后族，须杜舆言。乞下吏部检勘，苟无负犯，于格应留，请依资稍优注拟。」从之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21241,"number":12,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百一十二 (唐紀二十八) / 玄宗至道大聖大明孝皇帝上之下 / 七年 / 第 12 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"bca98a41-db0e-11ef-9417-a0d3651f611f","year_int":719},"tongjian_id":"bca98a41-db0e-11ef-9417-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"岐山","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"岐山縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"岐山县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"be2e3387-db0e-11ef-97f5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"扶風郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶风郡","start_index":4,"to